scn 1
# Three Drakes (Crusades) attack a patrolling Aramon Spyhawk (arafast): AirToAir (41ca50) pursues it, and
# its stage 2 steps out of the stack at the counter's threshold (D = (rand(15) + both footprints) x 16).
# The owner's 0.9.12 replay: the dogfighting drakes overlapped on 91% of their ticks.
name air-stack-duel
ticks 1800
seed 7
players 2
crusades on
weapons on
map flat 160 160
type drake fbi zondrake
type spy fbi arafast
group drakes 0 drake 3 cells 20,78 20,80 20,82
group spy 1 spy 1 cells 80,60 weapons=off
at 1 patrol spy 80 110
at 2 attack drakes @spy
pair stack drakes drakes cells=2
